1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,370
Every month, lenders send the same reminder,
at the same time, to everyone.

2
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,039
Kairos looks at every borrower,
every day, and decides.

3
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,087
Before anything goes out,

4
00:00:27,107 --> 00:00:32,345
Aladdin, our safety supervisor,
checks it against the lender's rules.

5
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:38,893
No reply on SMS.
So it learns, and tries WhatsApp.

6
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,450
Vikram: I'll pay by the 29th.

7
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,663
Your team stays in charge.

8
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,782
But even they can't break the rules.

9
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:08,580
Sunita: When is my EMI due?

10
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,029
Kairos: To protect your account,

11
00:01:10,049 --> 00:01:13,980
Kairos: I have sent a 6-digit code
to your registered WhatsApp number.

12
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,780
Kairos: Thank you, you are verified.

13
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:21,080
Kairos answers in seconds.
But only once it knows it's really them.

14
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:23,580
Sunita: I already paid,
here is the screenshot.

15
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:26,588
Kairos: For your security,
I can't help with this request in chat.

16
00:01:26,608 --> 00:01:28,980
Kairos: A specialist
from our team will review it.

17
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:32,579
A doctored payment screenshot?
It checks with the bank.

18
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:42,682
Sunita: Stop.

19
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:46,680
Kairos: You will not receive further
automated reminders from us on any channel.

20
00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:49,580
And stop means stop. Everywhere.

21
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:56,079
In our tests, about twice the money back
for every rupee. With zero rule breaches.

